        "original_id": "95f3d2db-0061-5d91-80c8-1cae4c1c96dc",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dylan Everett, Dean Winchester, Hunter Brochu, Ridge Canipe, Nicolai Lawton-Giustra, Brock Kelly, Chad Everett\n- TV series: How To Be Indie, Wingin' It, Open Heart\n- Companies: Epitome Pictures, DHX Media, marblemedia\n- Character: Dean Winchester\n\nFacts:\n- Dylan Everett is best known for roles in How To Be Indie from 2009 to 2011 and Wingin' It from 2010 to 2013.\n- Dylan Everett is also known for a role in a series listed for 2012 to 2013 with no title provided in the chunk.\n- In 2015, Dylan Everett was best known for a role in Open Heart.\n- Open Heart is a 2015 American-Canadian mystery-drama television series.\n- Open Heart was produced by Epitome Pictures, a unit of DHX Media, in association with marblemedia.\n- Dean Winchester has been portrayed in other versions by Hunter Brochu as a toddler, Ridge Canipe as a child, Nicolai Lawton-Giustra as a pre-teen, Brock Kelly and Dylan Everett as teens, and Chad Everett as an elderly version.",
